{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-multaqua-avenue","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"multaqua-avenue-dubai-investments-mirdif","about":"Al Multaqa Avenue is a commercial center in Mirdif Hills by developer Dubai Investmens, which includes Mirdif's first hotel. The four-star hotel comprises 116 rooms and 132 serviced apartments, including 300 studios and 1 and 2-bedroom apartments. There is more than 130,000 square feet of retail space with restaurants, cafes, stores and boutiques, as well as more than 60,000 square feet of office space.The main feature of the complex is its stunning architecture, stylish finishes with high quality materials and world-class amenities. The complex also features 24-hour security with video surveillance and a large parking lot.Mirdif Hills is characterized by functionality through a superb selection of purpose-built premium retail units. Restaurants, cafes and inspiring leisure and entertainment options are within walking distance.Dubai Festival City and Dubai International Airport are just 15 minutes away, while Dubai International Financial Centre, Dubai Internet City and Dubai Mall are within 20-30 minutes.","price":1350000,"title":"Multaqua Avenue","bitrix":{"id":626,"pf_id":"are.3.8912","source":null,"project_id":"Mirdif Hills","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Multaqua Avenue","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Dubai Investments","project_location":"Mirdif"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/651/images/2024/01/06/340x252/gV2jLmExR4T0cXMCNK8HfdihmRQbITH1wjCfIyXQ.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/651/images/2024/01/06/464x312/gV2jLmExR4T0cXMCNK8HfdihmRQbITH1wjCfIyXQ.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.2232335,"lng":55.4227837},"country":"dubai","images1":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/651/images/2024/01/06/340x252/6tJ6Ab